From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:32:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 56/79] VIF1: UNPACK with CYCLE still 0 reads its source data
 consecutively (CL treated as WL); PS2X_TRACE_FAULTS logs the codes before an
 invalid VIF1 code

Evidence: the game sends UNPACK V4-32 before any STCYCL; with CL=0 the size calculation consumed 0 bytes, the float data was decoded as VIF code 0x45000000, ER1 stalled DMA1 and EA's DMA wait timed out into a fatal path.

diff --git a/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_vif1_interpreter.cpp b/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_vif1_interpreter.cpp
index 05ac32906b52570e90ee7e4a23b6bda49ffc32a3..0bf7aae107e87cd9de200037b503b83b26a57df5 100644
--- a/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/ps2_vif1_interpreter.cpp
